					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I know Cross testing is considered taboo at best, but the whole time I was reading this entry I had one thought run though my head.</p> <p>&quot;What if someone testing these glasses was locked in a room with only &quot;ME&quot; would they give &quot;ME&quot; their name?&quot;</p> 
				 	]]>
