					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-251792#post-1353598</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-251792/scp-215#post-1353598</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 18 Jan 2012 19:30:42 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Syera</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>714774</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>When I read the title of the link, I thought that these were going to induce conspiranoid-type paranoia, and was a bit disappointed when it turned out that they just made you think that inanimate objects were out to get you. Not a bad SCP object, though.</p> <p>However, I will now go on thinking that conspiranoids are wearing cursed eyewear that makes them see conspiracies in every nook and cranny.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
